   "init": {
    "label": "Record cards",
    "body": "# One row at a time\nThe **Record** node shows a single frame row as labeled boxes. The layout is plain text: one line per grid row, names split by `|`, and repeating a name merges its cells (the `Photo` column spans all four rows). Flip records with the pager, or wire **Row** to drive the pick from the graph. A cell holding an image URL renders as the picture.",
    "color": "violet",
    "width": 360,
    "height": 190
   }
  },
